<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets Guangzhou Inv warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets Guangzhou Inv warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 600 million American-style call warrants on shares of Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$3.465	PREMIUM	    15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.09623    GEARING	    4.00X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.APR.98     PAYDATE	    05.MAY.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$3.85	 LISTING DATE     07.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>		     DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
